{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは(*´ω`*)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも応援ありがとうごさいます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はしくじり先生の収録＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/07/02/7158610/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"吉村さんから差し入れにいただいた(吉村さんが澤部さんにあげたやつを澤部さんからいただいた)原宿 瑞穂さんの大福！美味でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もまた競馬やろうかな( ´ ▽ ` )ははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"OA日等々はまたご連絡します！\n今日も沢山笑わせて\nいただきましたっ＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近真っ赤なドレスを\n着ることが多いです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/07/02/7158610/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BUBKAさんのアモーレグラビアの\nオフショット。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/07/02/7158610/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シャワーのシーンお気に入りです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/07/02/7158610/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Mステにて！\nこれも赤いドレスを纏う。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすーと並ぶにはこの小顔ポーズが\n必要となるのです。\nちなみにあすーは蕾のポーズらしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギガwithまいやん。\nライブの裏でマネージャーさんに\n撮ってもらいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kazumi.takayama/img/blog/kazumi.takayama/img/2016/07/02/7158610/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホワイトハイ◎\nこれからもよろしくです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまいの卒コンの初日も、\n楽しかったなぁ( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オフショットで写真がいっぱいに\nなってしまいましたな(｢･ω･)｢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のTHE MUSIC DAYは\n白にゴールドの刺繍をあしらった\n素敵な衣装でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"衣装が可愛いとテンション上がりますね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌番組楽しいな〜∩ˇωˇ∩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リトグリちゃんに会えなかったのだけが\n残念だったけど(´;ω;`)ぶわ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も充実した１日になりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も健康で平和に過ごせますよーに＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、今日はこの辺で！\n文字少なめですんません（；＿；）\nおやすみなさいっ☺︎！"}],"source":"archive"}